# Deny-by-default, then re-include exactly what the image build needs.
#
# The inverse (a list of things to skip) is one forgotten line away from
# baking `.revio.local.toml`, `.env`, or an audit report into a published
# layer, and image layers are not something you can quietly take back.
*

!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!src/

# Re-excluded even inside src/ — build artefacts, never sources.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/.DS_Store
